eeded\",\"Cancelled\",\"Timeout\",\"OperationFailed\"],\"effects\":[\"read\"],\"concurrency\":\"read\",\"approval\":\"none\",\"suspension\":[],\"examples\":[\"const result = await tools.task_get({ task_id: \\\"…\\\" });\"]},{\"name\":\"task_update\",\"category\":\"team\",\"uiLabel\":\"Task update\",\"contractVersion\":1,\"description\":\"Change a shared task. Actions: claim (pending, unblocked, unowned or assigned to you → in_progress, owned by you), release, complete (owner or parent), reopen, edit (subject/description), set_dependencies (blocked_by), assign (parent only; owner = teammate name, empty to unassign; notifies the teammate), delete (parent only). Pass expected_revision from task_get/task_list to avoid overwriting a concurrent change. Tasks owned by a member that stops are released.\",\"inputSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"task_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"action\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"claim\",\"release\",\"complete\",\"reopen\",\"edit\",\"set_dependencies\",\"assign\",\"delete\"]},\"expected_revision\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"minimum\":0},\"subject\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":200},\"description\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":12000},\"blocked_by\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":50},\"owner\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":40}},\"required\":[\"task_id\",\"action\"],\"additionalProperties\":false},\"resultSchema\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The formatted output (what a person reading the result would see)\"},\"images\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"Images the operation returned, kept by the host: pass one to attachments.add() to show it to the model with the ptc result\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"handle\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Opaque attachment handle\"},\"mimeType\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"requi